{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜结构图\n当前类与跨模块接口；运行路径见 [[GGYGO_流程_AbilitySystem.canvas|激活流程]]、[[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]、[[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害子图]]。[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 玩家 / AI 入口\n`HeroComponent::Input_AbilityInputTagPressed/Released` → 提交玩家标签。\n`BTTask_GGYGOActivateAbility` → 按 ActionTag 找 GA。\n[[Input/结构]] · [[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "host",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCombatantState\n`GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent()` → 提供 ASC。\n`AttachAvatar(Pawn)` / `DetachAvatar(Pawn)` → 切换 Avatar 并同步 ActorInfo。\n派生玩家 Slot 与 BossState。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\n`AbilityInputTagPressed/Released(Tag)` → 缓存本帧输入。\n`ProcessAbilityInput(dt, paused)` → 统一激活。\n`CanActivateAbilityByHandle(Handle, Reasons)` → 预检。\n`IsActivationBlockedByGroup(GA, Reason)` → 组仲裁。\n`SetAbilityGroupConfig` / `SetTagRelationshipMapping` → 注入规则。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 仲裁配置\n`UGGYGOAbilityGroupConfig`：GroupTag → 共存/独占/排队规则。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTagRelationshipMapping`：能力 Tag → 额外要求/阻断/取消 Tag。\n两者由 PawnData 注入 ASC。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\n`CanActivateAbility()` → 基础条件/成本/组检查。\n`ActivateAbility()` → 执行动作并可申请 CameraMode。\n`EndAbility()` → 释放组与镜头覆盖。\n`GetGroupTag()` / `GetActivationPriority()` → 仲裁输入。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "set",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySet\n`GiveToAbilitySystem(ASC, Handles, Source)` → 按 AttributeSet、GA、GE 顺序授予。\n`GrantedHandles::TakeFromAbilitySystem(ASC)` → 收回这次授予。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "attr",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthSet / CombatSet\nHealthSet：Damage/Healing/PoiseDamage 元属性与生命、韧性变更委托。\nCombatSet：BaseDamage/BaseHeal/BasePoiseDamage 供 Execution 捕获。",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "effect",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 伤害 / 表现接口\n`UGGYGODamageExecution::Execute` → 计算伤害并写目标元属性。\n`UGGYGOAbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent` → GA 等 Montage Event。\n`UGGYGOGameplayCueManager` → Cue 加载/分发。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1040,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
